# `yo fix <path> --migrate deref` over a migrated file whose `&pts.*` lends
# an `Rc`-handle binding (`pts : &List(T)`, `List(T)` an `Rc`): the old
# reading of that `.*` (the payload) does not fit `count`'s `&List(T)`
# parameter and stopped the file before its evidence site (`peek`'s `n.*`).
# The file is evaluated again as migrated text, so nothing is applied, the
# file evaluates and the tree keeps the fixture's main.yo
# (issues/fixed/2026-11-15-migrate-deref-doubles-a-swept-star-when-the-recorders-old-reading-aborts-the-files-evaluation.md).
stdout_keep=^fix:
timeout=240
